# Secrets. The dev account key lives in D:\Genlayer-project\wallet\.env, which
# has its own .gitignore. These are here so that anyone who copies a real .env
# into this tree, or adds one for another network, still cannot commit it.
.env
.env.local
# The adversarial proof records the pair it deployed, per machine. The canonical
# addresses are in the README; this file is just a convenience so re-runs do not
# deploy a new pair every time.
deployment.json
tests/adversarial/.env
.env.*.local
*.key

